# apps/web (Next.js)

- Default to Server Components. Add `'use client'` only for browser state or event handlers.
- Check a sibling page/layout/route before creating a new pattern.
- Use Next DevTools MCP for errors, routes, logs, and version-accurate Next docs. Keep `pnpm dev` running.
- Hosted on Vercel. Do not assume a long-lived Node server in this app (collaboration sockets belong in `apps/hocuspocus-server`).
- Server-only secrets: no `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` for keys.
- Sandbox vs `/ide` route choice: see `runtime-sandbox-ide.mdc`.
